CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/ai com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/SpreadingFire
	COMMENT SpreadFire - the spreading-fire tile (UnitType.spreadingFire). Own fields: a (static BitmapOrTexture[2] resource cache, only [0] = R.drawable.fire is loaded), b (image), c (fire type, only 0 supported: "Fire type:X is not supported"), d (animation frame 0-3), e (frame timer), f (random per-instance value), g/h (frame offsets), i/j (sprite offset x/y), k (initialised flag), and the growth model l (growth per tick = 5.0E-4), m (max size = 1.0), n (spread threshold = 0.3), o (current size), p (base size), q (spread timer). r = spreading already done this cycle. Statics: s (Point scratch), t (shared static FindSpreadFireRequest used by a(x,y)), u (Rect). Inherited: radius (cj), hp/maxHp (cu/cv), angle (cg), dead (bV), deathTime (bW), damageFlash (dp). f() samples the MapTile under the fire (MapTile.e/h/k/f are the water/rock/etc. flags) and gives up when the tile cannot burn; k() spreads to all 8 neighbours. [field names verified from code]
	FIELD a resourceCache [Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/m/e;
	FIELD b image Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/m/e;
